{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_21","type":"agent_message","text":"Straight collection is falsified: contact alone neither moves nor attaches a token. The crosswise transfer paths do work—after 76 clone actions all three `8`s form a top-owned vertical train, and after 72 actions all three `9`s form a left-owned horizontal train. The remaining problem is interference: using one loaded carriage to build the other train drags its cargo out of place, so the two collections must be interleaved or deliberately parked."}}
